        "original_id": "14032ef3-d03d-58d1-b43c-05d6e99ca502",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Chris Noonan\n- Awards: Academy Award for Best Director, Academy Award for Best Adapted Screenplay\n- Organizations: Academy of Motion Picture Arts and Sciences\n- Films: Babe, Miss Potter\n\nFacts:\n- Chris Noonan was born on 14 November 1952.\n- Chris Noonan is a Sydney-based Australian filmmaker and actor.\n- In 1995, Chris Noonan was best known for the family film \"Babe.\"\n- For \"Babe,\" Chris Noonan was nominated for the Academy Award for Best Director and the Academy Award for Best Adapted Screenplay.\n- The Academy Award for Best Director is officially known as the Academy Award for Best Directing.\n- The Academy Award for Best Director is presented annually by the Academy of Motion Picture Arts and Sciences.\n- In 2006, Chris Noonan directed \"Miss Potter,\" an Anglo-American biographical fiction family drama film.",
